# MIXINv2's Builtin/BooleanOr.mixin.yaml (the package mixinv2-library),
# desugared to the literal partial-function mixin encoding, a
# definition `L : V` written `λ"L" L. V`: after the key, a class whose self is
# named by the label. A lexical reference [a, w…] reads
# off the self of the nearest enclosing scope that writes a, a qualified one
# [S, ~, w…] off the self S, and an inherited mixin is applied to the
# inheritor's self. top is written out, the term of corpora/library/top.lambdalattice.
# The names BooleanOr, Builtin and mixin_builtin are the selves the directory tree
# binds. Written by a translator, a scratch prototype of that desugaring.
# FIXME: once the .mixin.yaml front end (#1520) reads MIXINv2's YAML, read https://github.com/Atry/private-overlay/issues/1520
# that YAML and delete this file.
Builtin Builtin "BooleanData" BooleanOr
+ (λ"BooleanFactory" BooleanFactory. ( (λ"Product" Product. (λ"Or" Or. ( (λ"other" other. BooleanFactory BooleanFactory "Product" other)
+ (λ"or" or. BooleanFactory BooleanFactory "Product" or))))
+ (λ"True" True. (λ"Or" Or. ( (λ"other" other. BooleanFactory BooleanFactory "Product" other)
+ (λ"or" or. BooleanFactory BooleanFactory "True" or))))
+ (λ"False" False. (λ"Or" Or. ( (λ"other" other. BooleanFactory BooleanFactory "Product" other)
+ (λ"or" or. Or Or "other" or))))))
